# Damage from a source with infect causes that source's controller to give the player poison counters (CR 120.3b,
# 702.90b), so "If you would put one or more counters on a permanent or player" (Innkeeper's Talent, level 3) is the infect
# creature's controller's, even in combat, where the damage is a turn-based action's (CR 510.2). Bot1's Glistener Elf deals
# Bot2 1 combat damage: two poison counters. (The Talent's level-1 trigger puts its counters on Bot1's Ornithopter.)

